#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:108
msgid "Choose a template."
msgstr "Vælg en skabelon."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:110
msgid "Choose where on the blank the design is printed."
msgstr "Vælg, hvor på basisproduktet designet skal trykkes."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:112
msgid "The blank no longer exists in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Basisproduktet findes ikke længere i Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:114
msgid ""
"The blank is deleted in Pixonaut. Restore it in the Pixonaut studio, or "
"choose another blank."
msgstr ""
"Basisproduktet er slettet i Pixonaut. Gendan det i Pixonaut-studiet, eller "
"vælg et andet basisprodukt."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:116
msgid ""
"The blank no longer has this placement, or Pixonaut cannot size a print for "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Basisproduktet har ikke længere denne placering, eller Pixonaut kan ikke "
"beregne en trykstørrelse til den."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:118
msgid "The template no longer exists in Pixonaut."
msgstr "Skabelonen findes ikke længere i Pixonaut."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:120
msgid ""
"The template is paused or deleted in Pixonaut. Make it live again, or choose "
"another template."
msgstr ""
"Skabelonen er sat på pause eller slettet i Pixonaut. Gør den aktiv igen, "
"eller vælg en anden skabelon."

#. translators: %d: most sides a product can have.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:124
#, php-format
msgid "A product has at most %d sides."
msgstr "En vare har højst %d sider."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:128
msgid "Two sides use the same placement. Each placement can be one side only."
msgstr "To sider bruger samme placering. Hver placering kan kun være én side."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:130
msgid "Two sides have the same key. Give each side its own."
msgstr "To sider har samme nøgle. Giv hver side sin egen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:132
msgid ""
"A custom print size needs a width and height in millimetres, both above zero."
msgstr ""
"En tilpasset trykstørrelse kræver en bredde og en højde i millimeter, begge "
"over nul."

#. translators: %d: most print sizes one side can offer.
#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:136
#, php-format
msgid "A side offers at most %d print sizes."
msgstr "En side tilbyder højst %d trykstørrelser."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:140
msgid ""
"Add a print size in millimetres. Without a blank there is no placement to "
"take one from."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj en trykstørrelse i millimeter. Uden basisprodukt er der ingen "
"placering at hente en fra."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:142
msgid "The print size is larger than the placement can print."
msgstr "Trykstørrelsen er større, end der kan trykkes på placeringen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:144
msgid "The print size does not match the template's aspect ratio."
msgstr "Trykstørrelsen passer ikke til skabelonens størrelsesforhold."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:146
msgid ""
"Pixonaut could not check the configuration. Check the connection, then "
"update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut kunne ikke tjekke opsætningen. Tjek forbindelsen, og opdatér "
"derefter varen igen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:148
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side. Check the side's "
"template, placement and print size, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ville ikke lave designet til en fast side. Tjek sidens skabelon, "
"placering og trykstørrelse, og opdatér derefter varen igen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:150
msgid ""
"Pixonaut would not make the design of a standing side: the store may not "
"create and approve designs. Check the connection's permissions in the "
"Pixonaut studio, then update the product again."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut ville ikke lave designet til en fast side: webshoppen må ikke "
"oprette og godkende designs. Tjek forbindelsens tilladelser i Pixonaut-"
"studiet, og opdatér derefter varen igen."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:152
msgid ""
"The template of a standing side does not fit the placement at any of the "
"blank's sizes, so none of them can be printed. Choose a template that fits."
msgstr ""
"Skabelonen til en fast side passer ikke til placeringen i nogen af "
"basisproduktets størrelser, så ingen af dem kan trykkes. Vælg en skabelon, "
"der passer."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:154
msgid ""
"The configuration was saved by a newer version of Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Update the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Opsætningen blev gemt af en nyere version af Pixonaut for WooCommerce. "
"Opdatér pluginet."

#: src/Catalogue/InvalidReason.php:156
msgid "Pixonaut cannot print this configuration."
msgstr "Pixonaut kan ikke trykke denne opsætning."

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Beside a template in the template search of the admin product page: the template cannot be printed at these sizes of the blank.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:88
msgid "Cannot print at %l"
msgstr "Kan ikke trykkes i %l"

#. translators: %l: the sizes, e.g. "XL and 3XL". Warning on a side of the admin product page.
#: src/Catalogue/MisfitSizes.php:104
msgid ""
"This template does not fit the placement at %l: it cannot be printed at "
"those sizes. Choose a template that fits every size, or stop selling those "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Denne skabelon passer ikke til placeringen i %l: den kan ikke trykkes i de "
"størrelser. Vælg en skabelon, der passer til alle størrelser, eller stop med "
"at sælge de størrelser."

#. translators: 1: width, 2: height, both in millimetres.
#: src/Catalogue/PrintSize.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s × %2$s mm"
msgstr "%1$s × %2$s mm"

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Site URL changed: this site is not the one that connected to Pixonaut, so "
"Pixonaut is paused here and nothing is sent for the site it was copied from. "
"Personalised products and orders are paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect "
"this site</a>. For a staging site, pick Sandbox."
msgstr ""
"Webstedets URL er ændret: dette websted er ikke det, der blev forbundet med "
"Pixonaut, så Pixonaut er sat på pause her, og der sendes intet for det "
"websted, det blev kopieret fra. Personaliserede varer og ordrer er sat på "
"pause, indtil du <a href=\"%s\">forbinder dette websted</a>. Vælg Sandbox "
"til et staging-websted."

#. translators: %s: link to the Pixonaut settings.
#: src/Connection/Connection.php:446
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Pixonaut no longer accepts this store's key: the store was disconnected in "
"Pixonaut, or its key was revoked. Personalised products and orders are "
"paused until you <a href=\"%s\">connect the store again</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pixonaut accepterer ikke længere denne webshops nøgle: webshoppens "
"forbindelse blev afbrudt i Pixonaut, eller dens nøgle blev tilbagekaldt. "
"Personaliserede varer og ordrer er sat på pause, indtil du <a "
"href=\"%s\">forbinder webshoppen igen</a>."

